Protecting Consumer Rights in California

California Lemon Law provides valuable protections for consumers dealing with recurring vehicle defects. When manufacturers cannot repair substantial defects within a reasonable number of attempts, the law offers pathways to compensation, replacement vehicles, and buybacks.

